    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">A coffee shop has <var>M</var> baristas. Each barista prepares one drink at a time.<br><br><var>N</var> customers arrive throughout the day. Customer <var>i</var> arrives at minute <var>A</var>i and orders a drink that takes <var>T</var>i minutes to prepare.<br><br>A drink may start only when:<br><br>the customer has already arrived, and<br>the assigned barista is not busy.<br>When several customers are waiting, the serving order may be chosen freely. Drinks cannot be interrupted once preparation has started.<br><br>The wait time of customer <var>i</var> is defined as:<br><br>&lt;div style=&quot;border: 1px solid #555; padding: 10px; margin: 10px 0; font-style: italic; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;<br>wait&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt; = (minute the drink is ready) &minus; <var>A</var>&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt;<br>&lt;/div&gt;<br>Find the minimum possible total combined wait time:<br><br>wait1 + wait2 + &hellip; + wait<var>N</var><br>All baristas are free at minute 0.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1</strong>: An integer <var>N</var> representing the number of customers.<br><strong>Line 2</strong>: <var>N</var> space-separated integers representing the preparation time <var>T</var> for each customer's drink.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1</strong>: A single integer representing the minimum total combined wait time.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &lt;= <var>N</var> &lt;= 1000<br>1 &lt;= <var>T</var> &lt;= 100</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">3\n5 2 3</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">17</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
